   "y": 731,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "realized by their own contract (see \"is …\"):\n  IMetadataRenderer  ← MetadataRenderer\n    tokenURI(uint256, string) → string\n  ISubnameRegistrar  ← SubnameRegistrar\n    createSubname / submitSubname /\n    getChildren / childrenLength / labelOf\n\nupstream interfaces:\n  IBaseRegistrar ← BaseRegistrar\n  IETHRegistrarController ← SimplexController\n  IPriceOracle ← price oracle\n  INameWrapper (kept only for PublicResolver)",
